libsodium.js is vendored (committed) in this directory as `libsodium.js`.

It is the "sumo" build of libsodium.js (includes crypto_box_seal), used by
approve.js to seal DEKs to the daemon's X25519 public key.

- Upstream:  https://github.com/jedisct1/libsodium.js
- Package:   libsodium-wrappers-sumo
- License:   ISC — see THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES in this directory.
- Size:      ~2MB (minified bundle).

To refresh it from upstream:

  npm install libsodium-wrappers-sumo
  cp node_modules/libsodium-wrappers-sumo/dist/modules/libsodium-wrappers-sumo.js ./libsodium.js

(Or download sodium.js from the "sumo" package at
https://github.com/jedisct1/libsodium.js/releases and place it here.)
